 z←(f TrapRequest)x;t;⎕TRAP;dmx
⍝ x ←→ Request Message
⍝ f ←→ OnRequest Function
 t←x.Connection.Server.Trap
 :If 0<⎕NC'#.ErrorParms.signal'
     ⎕TRAP←t/⊂#.ErrorParms.signal'C' '→∆CarryOn'
 :EndIf
 z←f x
 :Return
⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝

∆CarryOn:
 ⎕TRAP←0 'S'
 dmx←⎕DMX
 z←dmx ErrorInApplication x
 x.Connection.Server.Stats.OnRequestErrors+←1
⍝Done
